  "notes": "{早|はや}く is the adverb form of {早|はや}い.\n\nBASE ADJECTIVE:\n- {早|はや}い (early, fast)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {早|はや}く{起|お}きる (to wake up early)\n- {早|はや}く{帰|かえ}る (to go home early)\n- できるだけ{早|はや}く (as soon as possible)\n\nDISTINCTION:\n- {早|はや}い can mean both \"early\" and \"fast\"\n- {速|はや}い specifically means \"fast\" (speed)",
